## 1. Pod keeps restarting. How do you troubleshoot?

```bash
kubectl get pods
kubectl describe pod POD_NAME
kubectl logs POD_NAME
kubectl logs POD_NAME --previous
kubectl get events
```

Explanation: Check Pod events, application logs, resource limits and container exit reasons.

## 2. Pod is in Pending state. What will you do?

```bash
kubectl get pods

```bash
kubectl get pods
kubectl describe pod POD_NAME
kubectl logs POD_NAME
```

