```

Open browser:

http://localhost:8081

Expected output: Nginx Welcome Page.

Keep the terminal running while accessing the application. Press Ctrl+C to stop port forwarding.

## STEP 4: Scale Deployment from 2 to 5 Replicas

```bash
kubectl scale deployment library-app --replicas=5
```

Verify deployment:

```bash
kubectl get deployments
```

Verify Pods:

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

Check replica details:

```bash
