```

Expected output: Previous working application version is restored.

## STEP 9: Manual Scaling and Auto Scaling

Manual scaling:

```bash
kubectl scale deployment library-app --replicas=5
```

Enable Metrics Server:

```bash
minikube addons enable metrics-server
```

Set CPU resource requests:

```bash
kubectl set resources deployment library-app --requests=cpu=100m,memory=64Mi
```

Create Horizontal Pod Autoscaler:

```bash
kubectl autoscale deployment library-app --cpu-percent=50 --min=2 --max=5
